OL,3,GNEWSAFence lasts just five hours before
OL,4,Abeing ripped out
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new fence lasted just five hours
OL,7,Fbefore being ripped out in broad
OL,8,Fdaylight, according to a councillor.
OL,10,FThe wooden fence in Middlesbrough was
OL,11,Finstalled at about 14:00 BST on 18
OL,12,FAugust, but by 19:00 it had vanished.
OL,14,FLonglands and Beechwood independent
OL,15,FJoan McTigue said a resident who
OL,16,Freported the removal had been walking
OL,17,Fhis dog when he discovered it was gone.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
