OL,3,GNEWSAFence lasts just five hours before
OL,4,Abeing ripped out
OL,5,
OL,6,FMcTigue said the same fence had
OL,7,Fpreviously been removed and she had to
OL,8,F"hound" the council, even escalating
OL,9,Fthe issue to its chief executive, to
OL,10,Fget it replaced. The Labour-led council
OL,11,Fthanked residents for reporting issues.
